      "description": "Única superficie elevada; contiene Propuesta y Tareas.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tarjeta\"><div class=\"ds-label\">Propuesta</div><div class=\"ds-item\"><div class=\"ds-head\"><span>Escribir la propuesta</span><span class=\"ds-step\"><button class=\"ds-c\" aria-label=\"Quitar 5 minutos\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 12h12\"/></svg></button><span class=\"ds-min\">50 min</span><button class=\"ds-c\" aria-label=\"Añadir 5 minutos\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 6v12M6 12h12\"/></svg></button></span></div><div class=\"ds-acts\"><button class=\"ds-b ds-b-osc\">Empezar</button><button class=\"ds-b\">Guardar</button></div></div></div>",
      "css": ":host{--fondo:#f2f4f8;--tarjeta:#fff;--pastilla:#f6f7fa;--suave:#f1f3f6;--tinta:#1f2430;--secundario:#666e80;--sobre-oscuro:#fff;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-tarjeta{max-width:480px;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(20,30,50,.04);padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#1f2430;}.ds-label{font-size:14px;color:#666e80;}.ds-item{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;}.ds-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:17px;font-weight:300;}.ds-min{font-size:15px;color:#666e80;}.ds-acts{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;}.ds-step{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;}.ds-c{width:44px;height:44px;border:0;border-radius:4px;background:#f1f3f6;color:#1f2430;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}.ds-b{font:400 14px/1 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;height:44px;padding:0 20px;border:0;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;transition:opacity .2s;background:#f1f3f6;color:#1f2430;}.ds-b-osc{background:#1f2430;color:#fff;}"
